function wkLab(k,short){const m=/^(\d{4})-S(\d{2})$/.exec(k||'');return m?(short?'Sem '+(+m[2]):'Semana '+(+m[2])+' · '+m[1]):String(k||'')}
function wkSpan(k){const r=wkRange(k);if(!r)return '';const a=r.a.split('-'),b=r.b.split('-');return (+a[2])+(a[1]!==b[1]?' '+MES_C[+a[1]-1]:'')+' al '+(+b[2])+' '+MES_C[+b[1]-1]}
